             A[:,j] <- A[:,j] - Q[:,k] * R[k,j],  for all j>k.

         Original code:
             for (j = k+1; j < N; ++j) {
               for (i = 0; i < M; ++i)
                 A[i][j] -= Q[i][k] * R[k][j];
